  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>&#8712;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>R</mi></math> such that the equation, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math> has a solution. Then <math><mi>S</mi></math> is equal to:"
  },
